    "text": "12 hours ago Ahead of its first season in the Pac-12 Conference, family 4-packs are on sale for four San Diego State home football games. The four tickets can be purchased for $76 (plus fees), which includes parking (a combined $125 value). Additional seats can also be purchased for $20 apiece (plus fees). Read full article\n1",
